This is to inform you that the Board of Directors of the Alan Scott Enterprises Limited ('the Company') at its meeting held today i.e. Thursday, November 05, 2026 at 11:30 AM (IST), had approved the following matters: 

1. Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, together with the Limited review report of the auditors in terms of Regulation 33 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations 2015;

The Board Meeting of the Company commenced on 11:30 AM (IST) and concluded at 11: 59 AM (IST).

1. Approval of the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter and Half year ended 30th September, 2026;
2. To take on record the Limited Review Report by the Statutory Auditors for the Unaudited Standalone and Consolidated Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter and Half year ended on 30th September, 2026.
3. Approval of the Standalone and Consolidated Unaudited Statement of Assets and Liabilities for the half year ended 30th September, 2026;
4. Approval of the Standalone and Consolidated Unaudited Statement of Cash Flow for the half year ended 30th September, 2026;
5. Appointment of Mr. Hitesh Singh Parihar (M.No. A61540) as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company w.e.f. 5th November, 2026.
